he mechanical positions of moving machine components into electrical signals.\",\"Main characteristics Safety function based on positive break contacts in accordance with IEC 60947-5-1-3\u003cBR/>The opening break-before-make contacts are thus opened mechanically and reliably by actuator\u003cBR/>The devices are climate-resistant\u003cBR/>Various types of drive\"],\"manufacturer\":\"Siemens\",\"mpn\":\"3SE5112-0CE01\",\"logo\":\"https://media.rs-online.com/brand/M0206-01.jpg.jpg\",\"category\":\"Switches > Limit & Position Switches > Limit Switches\",\"brand\":{\"@type\":\"Brand\",\"name\":\"Siemens\"},\"itemCondition\":\"http://schema.org/NewCondition\",\"url\":\"https://in.rsdelivers.com/product/siemens/3se5112-0ce01/siemens-3se5-series-roller-lever-limit-switch-no/nc-ip66-ip67-metal-housing-400v-ac-max-24-v-6a-max/6842910\",\"additionalProperty\":[{\"@type\":\"PropertyValue\",\"name\":\"Brand\",\"value\":\"Siemens\"},{\"@type\":\"PropertyValue\",\"name\":\"Actuator Type\",\"value\":\"Roller Lever\"},{\"@type\":\"PropertyValue\",\"name\":\"Normal State Configuration\",\"value\":\"NO/NC\"},{\"@type\":\"PropertyValue\",\"name\":\"IP Rating\",\"value\":\"IP66, IP67\"},{\"@type\":\"PropertyValue\",\"name\":\"Maximum Current\",\"value\":\"24 V 6A\"},{\"@type\":\"PropertyValue\",\"name\":\"Housing Material\",\"value\":\"Metal\"},{\"@type\":\"PropertyValue\",\"name\":\"Maximum AC Voltage\",\"value\":\"400V\"},{\"@type\":\"PropertyValue\",\"name\":\"Maximum DC Voltage\",\"value\":\"400V\"},{\"@type\":\"PropertyValue\",\"name\":\"Connection Type\",\"value\":\"M20\"},{\"@type\":\"PropertyValue\",\"name\":\"Series\",\"value\":\"3SE5\"},{\"@type\":\"PropertyValue\",\"name\":\"Action Type\",\"value\":\"Snap Action\"},{\"@type\":\"PropertyValue\",\"name\":\"Length\",\"value\":\"119mm\"},{\"@type\":\"PropertyValue\",\"name\":\"Minimum Operating Temperature\",\"value\":\"-25°C\"},{\"@type\":\"PropertyValue\",\"name\":\"Depth\",\"value\":\"40.5mm\"},{\"@type\":\"PropertyValue\",\"